        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 86922, Modern Rosette for Cabinet Handles</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Modern Cabinet Backplate for Pulls is the perfect finishing touch. From kitchen cabinets to furniture pieces, this cabinet pull rosette will add that extra detail that really makes a space pop. The Modern Rosette for Cabinet Handles is available in a few sizes and will work with most <a href=\"/collections/emtek-cabinet-hardware\">Emtek Cabinet Pulls</a>. The Modern Cabinet Backplates is available in all the contemporary finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-86922-installed.jpg?v=1704354611\" width=\"142\" height=\"150\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"Emtek 86922 Installed\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Rosette for Cabinet Pulls:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Package includes (1) backplate.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-86922-specifications.pdf?v=1704262421\"><b>Emtek Modern Cabinet Backplate for Pull Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p><b>Available in 6 Sizes:</b></p>\r\n<table style=\"text;font-family: Verdana, helvetica, arial;font-size: 12px;color: #000000;\" width=\"600\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"3\" cellspacing=\"0\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"50%\">\r\n<b>EMT-86922:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 5-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Height: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Depth: 3/18\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-86923:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 6-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Height: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Depth: 3/18\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-86924:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 7-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Height: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Depth: 3/18\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n\r\n<td width=\"50%\">\r\n<b>EMT-86925:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 9-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Height: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Depth: 3/18\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-86926:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 10\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 11-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Height: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Depth: 3/18\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-86927:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 13-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Height: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Depth: 3/18\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern-5-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354501\" width=\"511\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
